A '''Roller Skater''' (Japanese: '''ローラースケート''' ''Roller Skate'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] introduced in [[Generation VI]]. They are depicted as teenagers moving around on [[Roller Skates|roller skates]] and wearing protective equipment. In the [[Battle Maison]], they specialize in {{t|Flying}}- and {{type|Electric}} Pokémon.

