==In the manga==
[[File:Roller Skater Adventures.png|thumb|230px|Roller Skaters in Pokémon Adventures]]
===Pokémon Adventures===
===={{MangaArc|X & Y}}====
In ''[[PS553|Sylveon Enchants]]'', a Roller Skater was seen in the Mini-game Corner, playing the [[Tile Puzzle]] minigame.

Several Roller Skaters appeared in ''[[PS564|Corphish Pinches]]'' at the {{rt|5|Kalos}} skating park. They watched and were impressed as {{adv|Tierno}} performed some tricks with his own roller skates.
